# BOT GPT — Conversational AI Platform

A production-grade Q&A assistant with General Chat and RAG (document-grounded) modes, built with FastAPI + Groq LLaMA 3.3 + SQLite.

## Features
- 🔐 User auth (register/login, session-based)
- 💬 General Q&A with rolling conversation history
- 📄 RAG mode — ask questions strictly from uploaded PDFs
- 🧠 Auto-summarization when history gets too long
- 🗂 Persistent chat history — reloads on login
- 🐳 Fully Dockerized

## Project Structure
```
bot-gpt/
├── apis/
│   ├── main.py              # FastAPI app + routes
│   ├── general_question.py  # General Q&A router
│   └── rag_question.py      # RAG router
├── app/
│   ├── auth.py              # Auth logic (bcrypt, sessions)
│   ├── chat_store.py        # DB operations for chats/messages
│   ├── database.py          # SQLite init + connection
│   ├── pdf_parser.py        # PDF text extraction
│   ├── chunker.py           # Chunking strategies
│   └── retriever.py         # Chunk retrieval logic
├── ui/
│   └── ui_main.py           # Streamlit frontend
├── tests/
│   └── test_core.py         # Unit tests
├── Dockerfile               # API container
├── Dockerfile.streamlit     # UI container
├── docker-compose.yml       # Local dev
└── requirements.txt
```

## Quickstart (local)

```bash
# 1. Clone and install
git clone https://github.com/YOUR_USERNAME/bot-gpt.git
cd bot-gpt
python -m venv venv && source venv/bin/activate
pip install -r requirements.txt

# 2. Set env vars
DATABASE_URL=postgresql://botgpt:botgpt@localhost:5432/botgpt
GROQ_API_KEY=your-groq-key

## Docker

```bash
docker compose up --build
# API → http://localhost:8000/docs
# UI  → http://localhost:8501
```

## Environment Variables

| Variable | Description |
|---|---|
| `GROQ_API_KEY` | Your Groq API key |
| `DB_PATH` | SQLite file path (default: `qa_assistant.db`) |
| `API_URL` | Backend URL for Streamlit (default: `http://127.0.0.1:8000`) |

## API Endpoints

| Method | Endpoint | Description |
|---|---|---|
| POST | `/auth/register` | Register new user |
| POST | `/auth/login` | Login → session_id |
| POST | `/general/ask` | General Q&A |
| POST | `/document/upload` | Upload PDF |
| POST | `/document/ask` | RAG Q&A |
| GET | `/user/chats` | Load all chats |
| DELETE | `/conversations/{id}` | Delete chat |
| GET | `/health` | Health check |
